Seized is a action, thriller, adventure film directed by Isaac Florentine.

3
00:15:56,250 --> 00:16:02,250
Hiding out with his son Taylor on the Mexican coast, Nero hopes to
put his violent Special Forces career behind him.

4
00:21:15,000 --> 00:21:21,000
But after Nero’s home is attacked and Taylor is abducted, the mysterious Mzamo
orders Nero to slaughter the members of three rival crime syndicates.

5
00:26:33,750 --> 00:26:39,750
If he fails, Taylor will die.

6
00:31:52,500 --> 00:31:58,500
Now, with bullets flying and bodies dropping as Nero completes his
mission, he races to find Mzamo’s hideout and seek revenge.

